      "writtenOn": "2021-07-06T00:11:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In case of product, we don\u0027t support PRODUCT_PRODUCT_VNDK_VERSION to be set other than \"current\". The code is incomplete for now. When the product partition supports building against the snapshots, it must have the similar code with the vendor variants.For now, platformVndkVersion and productVndkVersion must have the same value.\n\n\u003e is it possible that there are more than one vendor or product vndk versions? Which versions are installable or exported to Make?\n\nPrebuilt snapshots have their own version and generates the image variants with the VNDK version. When these are exported to Make, only the version matching with the BOARD_VNDK_VERSION will be exported with the .vendor suffix. The other versions will be `hide from make`. If the version is \"current\" the PLATFORM_VNDK_VERSION is used.",
      "parentUuid": "a114e6b1_ce96ec9d",
